        <body>
            <div xml:id="d457">

                <pb facs="0687" n="575" sameAs="frus:frus1907p1/pg575"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 1229/6.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Italian
                    Chargé</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-08-23"><hi rendition="#italic">August 23,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Chargé</hi>: In reply to your note of the
                    19th instant, I beg to inclose for the information of your Government copies of
                    the correspondence between this department and the British embassy in regard to
                    the renunciation of extraterritorial jurisdiction of the United States in
                    Zanzibar.</p>
                <p>A copy of the treaty of February 25, 1905, between the United States and
                    Zanzibar, is also inclosed.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
